**/build
**/build-*
**/*~
**/.vscode

# Emacs autosaves (#file#) and lock files (.#file). An empty docs/#wi2.f#
# was tracked for a while: it slipped past docs/*.f below, because an
# autosave's name ends in # rather than in the extension it shadows.
**/#*#
**/.#*

# LaTeX build artefacts
docs/*.aux
docs/*.log
docs/*.out
docs/*.toc
docs/*.fdb_latexmk
docs/*.fls

# Local reference material: papers kept in docs/ while the documentation is
# written. Not ours to redistribute, and not wanted in the history. Papers
# are ignored by default and our own two documents are opted in, so one
# dropped into docs/ later is caught without anyone remembering to.
docs/*.pdf
!docs/canonical-components.pdf
!docs/gshtrans-reference.pdf

# The same, for reference *source*: Fortran routines read while the 3-j
# recursion was implemented. Not ours, and the library derives nothing from
# them beyond the algorithm, which is the paper's.
docs/*.f
docs/*.f90
